@host = http://localhost:5164

### OpenAPI foundation
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Customer login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/customer/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0900000000",
  "password": "configured-test-password"
}

### Employee login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/employee/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staff@example.test",
  "password": "configured-test-password"
}
